 ens of local vendors with delicious vegan food\, refreshing drinks\, live 
 music\, kid’s zone\, wellness and nutrition information\, sustainable an
 d eco products\, and so much more. We have inspirational presentations and
  veggie food prep demos with samples throughout the day. This event is ind
 oor/outdoor and children under 13 are admitted free. Connect with compassi
 onate community and join us!
