DESCRIPTION:Fall is nearly here and so is our third Community Gardeners’
  Exchange🪴\n\nNext Saturday\, come by the garden with your plants and g
 ardening supplies and exchange them for new ones to start your fall garden
 !\n\nExamples of items to exchange are gloves\, seeds\, recent harvets\, p
 lants\, cuttings\, hand tools and more\n\nThe exchange is a day to connect
  with the local gardening community\, prevent usable items from going to t
 he landfill\, and find new gems to add to your garden!
