X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Help Save Newts: Call for Volunteers
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T120000
UID:260822TZlHFeAlvUmI_vFTqdn_zA
DESCRIPTION:Volunteers Needed to Save Newts\n\nThe Chileno Valley Newt Bri
 gade is gearing up to rescue the thousands of newts\, frogs and other crea
 tures as they migrate across a dangerous road. Can you help?\n\nThe traini
 ng will be held on Sept. 26th on Chileno Valley Road in Petaluma.\n\nWhat:
  Wearing a reflective vest\, you’ll use a flashlight and bucket to carry
  animals across the road. You’ll also keep count using iNaturalist\, col
 lecting data that reveals population trends.\n\nWhen:  You'll join a team
  that goes out once a week between mid-October and mid-March.\n\nRegistrat
 ion required: go to www.chilenovalleynewtbrigade.org and fill out the volu
 nteer form.
LOCATION:Chileno Valley Newt Brigade
URL:http://www.chilenovalleynewtbrigade.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
