DESCRIPTION:Join us for a day of shopping\, wellness\, and community at M
 ade With Love\, a local gift boutique and wellness fair celebrating the pe
 ople\, businesses\, and organizations that make Petaluma such a special pl
 ace to live\, work\, and thrive.\n\nExplore a diverse collection of local 
 artisans\, makers\, wellness vendors\, food and beverage vendors\, handmad
 e goods\, unique gifts\, wellness products\, and community resources while
  connecting with friends\, neighbors\, and local business owners.\n\nWheth
 er you're searching for one-of-a-kind treasures\, looking for wellness ins
 piration\, enjoying family-friendly activities\, or simply spending the da
 y supporting local businesses\, there's something for everyone to enjoy.\n
 \nEvent Highlights\n\nLocal artisans\, makers\, and small businesses\n\nHa
 ndmade gifts and specialty goods\n\nWellness resources\, services\, and pr
 oducts\n\nWellness classes and demonstrations\n\nFood and beverage vendors
 \n\nFamily-friendly activities\n\nCommunity organizations and resources\n\
 nPrize giveaways throughout the event\n\nFree admission\n\n📍 1301 Sout
 hpoint Blvd.\, Petaluma\, CA\n\n📅 Saturday\, September 26\, 2026 🕙
  10:00 AM – 2:00 PM\n\nCome shop local\, support small businesses\, dis
 cover wellness resources\, enjoy local food and drinks\, and celebrate com
 munity—all in one place.\n\n--- Interested in becoming a vendor?\n\nWe'r
 e currently accepting applications from local artisans\, makers\, wellness
  providers\, food and beverage vendors\, and small businesses. Vendor boot
 hs are free\, and we welcome businesses that are excited to engage with th
 e community and help promote the event.\n\nFor vendor information and appl
 ications\, please contact us at marketing@petalumadental.com.
LOCATION:Petaluma Dental Group | Allume Med Spa | Luminary Education Cente
 r
