UID:26091002_G0dUHO0iEaKiKzcplrw
DESCRIPTION:Put on your curiosity hat as we explore the woodlands and pond
 s on the Galbreath Wildlands Preserve to see what is going on. We’ll put
  some of our attention on gall wasps and their intricate relationship with
  plants\, but our excitement will be focused on discovering things we don
 ’t necessarily know we will find. We hope to encounter dragonflies and d
 amselflies skimming over the pond\; scorpions under coverboards\; wolf spi
 ders hiding in plain sight\; harvestmen \\(Daddy Long Legs\\) lumbering al
 ong\; and who knows what else???
LOCATION:Galbreath Wildlands Preserve
