X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sebastopol Calendar": "https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/the-art-of-lap-loom-tapestry-weaving/", "North Bay Bohemian": "https://gathersebastopol.com/products/the-art-of-lap-loom-tapestry-weaving", "Press Democrat": "https://gathersebastopol.com/products/the-art-of-lap-loom-tapestry-weaving"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sebastopolcalendar": "https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/the-art-of-lap-loom-tapestry-weaving/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sebastopolcalendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Sebastopol Calendar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T130000
DTSTAMP:20260902T180521Z
CREATED:20260902T180521Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260902T180521Z
UID:10008947-1790416800-1790427600@sebastopolcalendar.com
SUMMARY:The Art of Lap Loom Tapestry Weaving
DESCRIPTION:Learn the foundations of tapestry weaving with Hanna “The Wool Witch” in this beginner-friendly lap loom workshop. You’ll learn how to set up and warp a loom before experimenting with yarn\, wool roving\, denim scraps\, and other fibers to create texture and dimension in your own woven wall hanging. \nIn this workshop\, you’ll:\n* Learn how to prepare and warp a wooden lap loom\n* Practice foundational tapestry weaving techniques\n* Experiment with different fibers\, materials\, and textures\n* Create your own woven wall tapestry\n* Take home both your finished tapestry and the wooden lap loom you learned on so you can continue weaving \nNo prior weaving experience required. All materials are included.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/the-art-of-lap-loom-tapestry-weaving/
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol\, 122 N. Main Street\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Skill-Building Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Tapestry-Weaving.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sebastopolcalendar": "https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/honoring-the-sacred-feminine/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sebastopolcalendar
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Calendar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T160000
DTSTAMP:20260912T003356Z
CREATED:20260912T003356Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260912T003356Z
UID:10008969-1790416800-1790438400@sebastopolcalendar.com
SUMMARY:Honoring the Sacred Feminine
DESCRIPTION:A Day of Reflection and Exploration For Men and Women\nConducted by Ginny Matthews & Regina Sara Ryan \nThe Sacred Feminine is an energetic life force that is present (at least in seed-form) in all of us\, whatever our gender. Disconnected from this aspect of our essential nature\, we lose touch with the full promise and possibility of Life. This gathering is designed to encourage us all (men & women) to recognize and renew our dedication to this Sacred Feminine power of creation: the power that supports life in all forms\, nurtures health and happiness in ourselves and others\, and forgives\, blesses and eases pain and suffering wherever it is found. The responsibility\, privilege and joy of honoring and renewing this Sacred Feminine Principle in our world today is a necessity…and now more than ever. \nGinny and Regina will lead us in a few meaningful rituals\, and encourage us to create our own that we can integrate into daily life. They will offer some guidance in meditation practice\, and allow time to “write from the heart\,” as a way to keep our connection to heart alive. Music\, movement and chant will allow us to celebrate what we know\, what we are\, and make an offering to others.\nYou can use this day to rest and inspire yourself in the company of other pilgrims on a sacred path. A chance to put away cellphones\, computers\, family and business work\, to deepen your connection with nature\, and to focus on what feeds your soul.\nIf interested in participating\, please contact Ginny Matthews at myosho@sonic.net so we may prepare the space and expect you.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/honoring-the-sacred-feminine/
LOCATION:Tayu House\, Sebastopol
ORGANIZER;CN="Tayu Order":MAILTO:myosho@sonic.net
END:VEVENT
