DESCRIPTION:Join us for one weekend only at Grand Cru Custom Crush for a s
 pecial Cellar Sale Event featuring a curated selection of phenomenal bouti
 que wines from some of our Grand Cru members — all at 60%\\+ off\, with 
 bottles available to purchase individually or by the case — buy as much 
 or as little as you’d like.\n\nCome taste\, shop\, and discover some tru
 ly special boutique wines at prices you won’t typically see. Whether you
 ’re looking for wines to enjoy now\, stocking your cellar\, or simply lo
 ve a great wine deal\, there will be plenty to explore — and taste!\n\nS
 hop a selection of: Rosé\, Chardonnay\, Pinot Noir\, Syrah\, Cabernet Sau
 vignon\, and more!\n\nSaturday\, September 26 & Sunday\, September 27\n\n1
 1 AM–3 PM both days\n\nGrand Cru Custom Crush | 1200 American Way\, Wind
 sor\, CA\n\nIN-PERSON ONLY — this sale will not be available online.\n\n
 Come early\, taste through the wines\, shop the cellar\, and take home som
 e incredible bottles at exceptional prices.\n\nPlease RSVP to let us know 
 you’ll be joining us!\n\nOne weekend only — once it’s gone\, it’s 
 gone!
LOCATION:Grand Cru Custom Crush
URL:https://www.grandcrucustomcrush.com/upcoming-events/grand-cru-cellar-s
 ale
