SUMMARY:Grand Opening New Yarn & Fiber Shop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T180000
UID:904ac5093c83abfd432fd5fecc0588c4@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:❤️ FROM MOM'S KITCHEN TO MY OWN YARN SHOP ❤️ I've been
  knitting and crocheting since I was 9 years old. In 2016\, I started dyei
 ng fiber in my mom's kitchen. What started as something I loved slowly gre
 w into something much bigger. In 2020\, That Fiber Bish officially began\,
  primarily online and at in-person events. After years of dreaming about h
 aving my own shop\, I'm finally making it happen. And I couldn't think of 
 a better place to do it than HOME — Santa Rosa. ❤️ So here we are…
  🧶 THAT FIBER 
LOCATION:Santa Rosa\, CA\, 631 4th St Ste 16\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95404
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/grand-opening-new-yarn-fiber-sho
 p/
X-SOURCE:Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
