DESCRIPTION:Join us for live music in our tasting room! Reserve your spot 
 for this Saturday Live Music & Tasting Experience\, where exceptional win
 es\, laid-back vibes\, and great live music come together for an unforgett
 able afternoon.\n\nFeatured Band\n\nBrothers of Siren Brothers of Siren i
 s an acoustic duo featuring Leah Van Dyke and Jake Richmond\, bringing ove
 r 20 years of Bay Area performance experience. Their warm harmonies and ac
 oustic-driven sound create the perfect laid-back soundtrack for an afterno
 on of wine and live music.\n\nDetails\n\nWalk-ins are welcome\, but priori
 ty seating is given to wine club members and guests with reservations. Thi
 s event tends to fill up quickly\, so we highly recommend making a reserva
 tion to secure your table. No outside food is allowed\, but we are dog and
  family friendly. For large groups of 13 or more\, please email us at visi
 t@spicyvines.com.
