SUMMARY:50th Anniversary Grand Tasting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T190700
UID:260722rQ80ZsD80Uas9oceUtQGQA
DESCRIPTION:Hosted at one of our founding members\, Foppiano Vineyards.  T
 his event will feature a grand walk-around tasting with 50 wineries pourin
 g \\(about 150 wineries being featured\\)\, amazing food from our local re
 nowned chefs/restaurants\, live music…wear dancing shoes\, a silent auct
 ion benefitting the Redwood Empire Food Bank and The Healdsburg Museum \\(
 also celebrating their 50th\\).  We wanted to beat the heat of the day\, a
 nd catch a glimpse of the sun setting\, so we’ll be celebrating from 4:0
 0-7:00pm. Tickets are now on sale exclusively through the 50 participating
  wineries. Want to buy ticket before June 30th? DM us and we'll put you in
  touch with a participating winery
