SUMMARY:Hardly Strictly Irish Harvest Moon Concert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T183000
UID:260925wniYFCslbEukeLHaqBYm0w
DESCRIPTION:**Hardly Strictly Irish Harvest Moon Concert & Potluck/Dance P
 arty**\n\nSeptember 26\, 2026\n\nConcert 5:00-6:30 p.m. | Potluck After-Pa
 rty 6:30-7:30 p.m.\n\n**TICKETS:** **$25 General / $20 Seniors & Youth** |
  **At The Door $35 General / $30 Seniors & Youth (doors at 4:30 p.m.)**\n\
 n**Hardly Strictly Irish** (Suzuki Cady and Jimmy Murphy) bring an uplifti
 ng\, warm\, and soulful energy\, and a signature blend of traditional Iris
 h tunes and Appalachian\, country-folk\, and roots-Americana songs. Their 
 rich sound features the fiddle\, mandolin\, guitar\, banjo\, bodhrán\, an
 d vocal harmonies.\n\n**Shiloh Step Irish Dance** will perform and teach a
  Ceili (group dance) after the show\, for anyone interested. Bring a potlu
 ck dish (optional) to share after the show in honor of the Harvest Moon!\n
 \nThe venue is beautiful\, with great acoustics\, comfortable seats\, room
  to dance\, and easy parking! And a lovely fountain garden area with seati
 ng to enjoy after the show.\n\nSt. Stephen’s Sanctuary\, 500 Robinson Ro
 ad\, Sebastopol CA\n\nMore information: http://suzukicady.com/tix\n\nAdvan
 ce Tickets: https://tixfox.co/e/harvestmoon
LOCATION:St. Stephen's Sanctuary
URL:https://tixfox.co/e/harvestmoon
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
