DESCRIPTION:Join us for the opening reception of The Real-Life Art History
  of M. Louise Stanley and celebrate one of the Bay Area’s most beloved a
 rtists. Discover the photographs\, sketchbooks\, studies\, and finished wo
 rks that reveal how Stanley transformed everyday experiences into her imag
 inative\, humorous\, and unforgettable art. Saturday\, September 26\, 5 
 – 7 PM Event is free for SVMA Members/$10 for non-members. Online regist
 ration closes 9/25 at 5 pm.
