UID:260916BEvZiCnq402wJskLhVF9-A
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a talent show with a little extra spark! **Highl
 y Talented** takes over **The Lounge at Mercy** on Saturday\, September
  26 for a night of live performances\, crowd participation\, cannabis\, an
 d seriously entertaining local talent. Sponsored by our friends at Soma Ro
 sa Farms\, Halara Vapes\, and Mercy Wellness.\n\nSingers\, dancers\, comed
 ians\, musicians\, specialty acts\, and more will take the stage and show 
 us what they’ve got. With **live judges and an audience vote**\, you wo
 n’t just be watching the show—you’ll be part of deciding who comes o
 ut on top.\n\nThe top performer **gets $500** and will be featured in up
 coming Mercy Wellness email marketing. Think you've got what it takes to w
 in?? Sign up here for a shot at performing: https://docs.google.com/forms/
 d/e/1FAIpQLSdhFtXvM6Z5InoYlcBwB4LZAgHku9gZ1ASYTOZRL3FvRMeqOA/viewform?usp=
 header\n\nCome early\, get settled in\, enjoy the lounge\, and get ready t
 o cheer on your favorites when the show starts.\n\n**Date & Time**\n\n**Da
 te:** Saturday\, September 26\, 2026\n\n**Pre-Party:** 6:00 PM\n\n**Tale
 nt Show:** 7:00 PM – 10:00 PM\n\n**What to Expect**\n\n🎤 **Live Per
 formances**\n\nWatch local performers bring their best to the Highly Talen
 ted stage.\n\n⭐ **Live Judges**\n\nOur judges will be watching\, reacti
 ng\, and helping narrow down the competition.\n\n👏 **Audience Vote**\n
 \nThe crowd gets a say. Come ready to support your favorite act and help d
 ecide who rises to the top.\n\n💰 **Winner Gets $500**\n\nOne performer
  will leave the stage with bigger pockets and a feature in upcoming Mercy 
 Wellness email marketing.\n\n🌿 **An Elevated Night Out**\n\nEnjoy the 
 show inside The Lounge at Mercy with good people\, great entertainment\, a
 nd even better smoke.\n\n**Tickets**\n\n**🐦 Early Bird General Admissio
 n — Available Through September 4**\n\nLock in early bird pricing for ge
 neral admission before it’s gone.\n\n**🎟 General Admission**\n\nEntry
  to **Highly Talented** with access to the full talent show from 6–10 
 PM.\n\nSeating is subject to availability\, so arrive early\, get comforta
 ble\, and settle in before the performances begin.\n\n**Think You’re Hig
 hly Talented?**\n\nWe’re still looking for performers to take the stage.
 \n\n**Audition sign-ups close September 18.**\n\nContestants who sign up r
 eceive:\n\n✨ A goodie bag\n\n🎟 One additional General Admission ticke
 t for a guest\n\n💰 The opportunity to get **$500**\n\n📧 A feature i
 n upcoming Mercy Wellness email marketing if selected as the winner\n\nAud
 ition registration and talent submission are handled separately from Gener
 al Admission tickets.\n\n**A Talent Show With a Little Extra Spark.**\n\n*
 *21+ Only | DCC # C12-0000420-LIC**\n\n**Event Terms & Conditions**\n\nThi
 s event is **21+ only**. A valid government-issued ID is required for ent
 ry.\n\nBy attending an event at **The Lounge at Mercy**\, you acknowledge
  that photography and video recording may occur. Images and video captured
  during the event may be used by Mercy Wellness for marketing and promotio
 nal purposes without compensation.\n\nTickets are non-refundable unless ot
 herwise stated. Event details\, performers\, timing\, judging\, and progra
 mming are subject to change without notice.\n\nCannabis consumption is per
 mitted only in designated areas and must comply with all applicable local 
 and state regulations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venu
 e\, you agree to comply with all venue policies and house rules.
LOCATION:The Loung at Mercy 
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/mercys-highly-talented-14966
