SUMMARY: Introduction to Dry Media Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Staff team member\, Crash\n\nDate: Saturday\, Sept
 ember 26\n\nTime: 11am - 1pm\n\nLocation: San Rafael store\n\nWORKSHOP IS
  FREE!! Space is very limited\, reserve your spot.\n\nDiscover the versat
 ility of dry media in this introductory\, hands-on workshop. Explore a va
 riety of traditional drawing materials\, including graphite\, colored pen
 cils\, charcoal\, and pastels\, while learning fundamental techniques for
  creating value\, texture\, blending and expressive mark making.\n\n\nThi
 s workshop offers the opportunity to experiment with different materials 
 and develop a better understanding of their unique characteristics and ap
 plications.\n\nAll materials are provided. All participants will receive 
 a free sample kit of PanPastel.
