DESCRIPTION:Born and raised in the small town of Canton\, South Dakota\, T
 yler Halverson brings a fresh\, unfiltered voice to modern country music. 
 Blending classic country and western influences with a rock-and-roll spiri
 t\, sharp songwriting\, and stories shaped by life on the road\, Halverson
  creates music for cowboys\, hippies\, drifters\, and everyone in between.
  Following his Grand Ole Opry debut and the release of his deeply honest a
 lbum *In Defense of Drinking*\, he brings his unmistakable sound to the M
 ystic Theatre on Saturday\, September 26.\n\nhttps://www.tylerhalverson.co
 m/\n\nOpening the show is - Ben Garcia\n\nhttps://bengarciamusic.com/\n\nB
 orn on the Wasatch Front and raised at the foot of the Rockies\, Ben Garci
 a got his musical start with early success in the alternative rock scene. 
 Yet\, after years on long Western highways—often with only bird dogs\, h
 orses\, and a Gibson Guitar as companions—his music picked up grit from 
 mountain passes and country roads. His songs drive through sometimes stark
 \, sometimes sublime landscapes towards a jagged but unbroken skyline\, st
 opping occasionally at Honky Tonk bars to tell stories of rough\, worn cow
 boy hats\, boots\, and tales lov
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://wl.eventim.us/event/tyler-halverson/703317?afflky=MysticTheatr
 e2
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
