UID:2609250kc8790VLkaumUe50rIfAA
DESCRIPTION:*HALLOWINE WALK*\n\n*Trick\, Treat\, & Taste in Yountville*\n\
 n***Saturday\, October 24\, 2026 12:00 – 4:00 p.m. Washington St. | Youn
 tville***\n\nCelebrate Halloween with a spirited afternoon in the heart of
  Yountville!\n\nJoin us for the inaugural **Hallowine Walk: Trick\, Treat 
 & Taste in Yountville**\, where wine\, Halloween\, and small-town charm co
 me together for a one-of-a-kind fall experience.\n\nYour ticket includes a
  commemorative wine cup\, event wristband\, and tasting map. After checkin
 g in at Veterans Memorial Park\, you’ll stroll through Yountville\, visi
 ting participating wineries\, tasting rooms\, restaurants\, and local busi
 nesses while enjoying wine tastings\, festive décor\, seasonal surprises\
 , and exclusive event-day offerings. \n\n**Costumes are encouraged**\, so
  gather your friends\, dress in your Halloween best\, and enjoy an unforge
 ttable afternoon of wine\, treats\, and festive fun!\n\n**Ticket Includes:
 **\n\nHallowine Walk cup\n\nWine tastings at participating locations\n\nEv
 ent wristband and tasting map\n\nAccess to exclusive event-day specials an
 d promotions\n\nA festive afternoon exploring downtown Yountville\n\nCheer
 s to a hauntingly good time—we can’t wait to see you there!\n\nMust be
  21+ to participate.
LOCATION:Town of Yountville
URL:https://yountville.com/hallowine-walk/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/jumpstart-your-art/", "Creative Sonoma": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/jumpstart-your-art/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/jumpstart-your-art/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Jumpstart Your Art
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260928T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260928T160000
UID:260629JFD2k_sSzU2cPMvZ4T_uJQ
DESCRIPTION:Every person experiences an ebb and flow to the tides of their
  creativity. We will share space together to design\, exchange ideas\, and
  hold ourselves accountable to our unique interests! The first portion of 
 our time together will involve a check-in discussion of ‘what is'\, lead
 ing into ‘what could be'. The talk will be facilitated by Erin Partridge
 \, an art therapist with a long history of supporting people in reengaging
  with creativity. After our initial talk\, we will have some time to indiv
 idually focus on our creative practices in the space of the gallery. Befor
 e we close\, we will share anything that came up in the process. Bring you
 r ideas\, a project\, and an interest in creative community. Please be min
 dful of what you choose to show up with-something quiet\, easy to clean up
 \, and non-disruptive to your fellow creatives. Not sure where to begin? S
 ome basic materials are available\, thanks to a donation from  Blick Art M
 aterials . Open for all ages-youth under 12 with an adult chaperone please
 ! Mondays\, 1-4 PM Facilitator: Erin Partridge
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/jumpstart-your-art/
X-SOURCE:Creative Sonoma, North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
