DESCRIPTION:Election day is right around the corner! Learn who is running 
 for city council\, mayor\, or local office in your city by watching a cand
 idate forum. Hosted by the League of Women Voters of Sonoma County\, a non
 partisan\, nonprofit organization dedicated to voter education.\n\nHear di
 rectly from candidates in Sonoma County and ask them questions live\, on Z
 oom. All forums will be posted to our YouTube channel after each forum.\n\
 nFind your city's forum on our event calendar at lwvsonoma.org for Zoom we
 binar links and details. Click the event on the calendar for full details.
 \n\nFull forum schedule\n\nMon\, Sept 28\, 6:00 PM — Sonoma City Council
 \, District 1\n\nTue\, Sept 29\, 6:00 PM — Cloverdale City Council\, 3 s
 eats\n\nWed\, Sept 30\, 6:00 PM — Windsor Mayor and Town Council\, Distr
 ict 1\n\nThu\, Oct 1\, 6:00 PM — Sebastopol City Council\, 3 seats\n\nMo
 n\, Oct 5\, 7:15 PM — Healdsburg City Council\, District 2\n\nWed\, Oct 
 7\, 6:00 PM — Santa Rosa City Council\, District 4\n\nThu\, Oct 8\, 6:00
  PM — Rohnert Park City Council\, Districts 2 and 5\n\nAlso check out th
 ese forums from our partners this October:\n\n— KRCB\, local broadcasts 
 of Sonoma County Supervisor forums\n\n— AAUW Petaluma\, Petaluma Mayor a
 nd City Council forums
URL:https://www.lwvsonoma.org/content.aspx?page_id=4091&club_id=720180&ite
 m_id=3060921
