 -class speech and leadership training to the good people of Marin.\n\n​C
 ome celebrate this monumental mile stone by participating\, learning or jo
 ining in the fun.\n\n​Our meetings are interactive and supportive\, comb
 ining prepared speeches\, impromptu speaking\, and helpful feedback. It’
 s a practical\, low-pressure way to build confidence\, think on your feet\
 , and become a more effective communicator.\n\n​Come join the community 
