SUMMARY:Candidate Forum for Windsor Mayor and Town Council by LWV
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260930T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260930T180000
UID:2609191Uz2r70vfkCSnN63XIDNkg
DESCRIPTION:Election day is coming soon! And it's not always easy to learn
  about local candidates. Learn who is running for city council\, mayor\, o
 r other local office in your city by watching a candidate forum. Sept 30\,
  6:00 PM: Windsor Mayor and Town Council\, District 1 Forum.\n\nHear direc
 tly from candidates in Sonoma County and ask your own questions live\, all
  on Zoom. Hosted by the League of Women Voters of Sonoma County.\n\nFind y
 our city's forum on our event calendar at lwvsonoma.org for Zoom webinar l
 inks and details. Click the event on the calendar for full details.\n\nAll
  forums will be posted to our YouTube channel after each forum.\n\nAll Son
 oma County forums\n\nMon\, Sept 28\, 6:00 PM: Sonoma City Council\, Distri
 ct 1\n\nTue\, Sept 29\, 6:00 PM: Cloverdale City Council\, 3 seats\n\nWed\
 , Sept 30\, 6:00 PM: Windsor Mayor and Town Council\, District 1\n\nThu\, 
 Oct 1\, 6:00 PM: Sebastopol City Council\, 3 seats\n\nMon\, Oct 5\, 7:15 P
 M: Healdsburg City Council\, District 2\n\nWed\, Oct 7\, 6:00 PM: Santa Ro
