X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Tom Schwedhelm for Supervisor 2026 Community Engagement Series Hea
 ldsburg
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T190000
UID:26092333gYzeh1qE2EwtFNbQq0lQ
DESCRIPTION:I hope you will join us for Round 2 of Our Community Engagemen
 t Series. This is a series of 5 meetings in Northern Sonoma County\, with 
 meetings planned in Santa Rosa\, Windsor\, Geyserville\, Cloverdale and He
 aldsburg \\(more info on all meetings below\\). All meetings will run from
  5:30pm to 7:00pm and all are free to attend - I hope to see you there! I 
 am proud to be the only candidate for Supervisor hosting a Community Engag
 ement Series\, and welcome the opportunity to connect with you\, your neig
 hbors\, and all North County residents!\n\nTOM SCHWEDHELM’S COMMUNITY EN
 GAGEMENT SERIES\n\nFive Meetings to Choose From:\n\n1. SANTA ROSA: Tuesday
 \, September 15 at the Luther Burbank Center for the Arts \\(50 Mark West 
 Springs Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95403\\)\n\n2. WINDSOR: Tuesday\, September
  22 at the Windsor Community Center \\(901 Adele Drive\, Windsor\, CA 9549
 2\\)\n\n3. GEYSERVILLE: Monday\, September 28 at the at the Oriental Commu
 nity Hall \\(1000 Hwy 128\, Geyserville\, CA 95441\\)\n\n4. CLOVERDALE: Tu
 esday\, September 29 at the Cloverdale Citrus Fair Tea Room \\(1 Citrus Fa
 ir Drive\, Cloverdale\, CA 95425\\)\n\n5. HEALDSBURG: Thursday\, October 1
  at the Healdsburg High School Cafeteria/Multi-Purpose Room \\(1024 Prince
  Avenue\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448\\)
LOCATION:Healdsburg High School (Cafeteria/Multi-Purpose Room)
URL:https://www.votetom.com/events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Belly Dancing with Raja - Thursdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T183000
UID:260817Y52xJ8PIvEGLiwnTvsJzjA
DESCRIPTION:DATE AND TIME: Thursdays\, 5:30 PM\n\nUnlock your inner streng
 th and find your flow. Belly dancing with Raja is an innovative fusion cl
 ass that blends the rhythmic artistry of belly dance with the high-energ
 y benefits of aerobics. Designed to be both a cardiovascular challenge an
 d a deep toning session\, this class focuses on the “powerhouse” of th
 e body—your core.\n\nBy layering fluid\, isolative movements over an ath
 letic aerobic base\, you will challenge your muscles in ways traditional g
 ym workouts can’t reach.\n\nWhat to Expect in Belly Dancing Class\n\n•
  Core-Centric Power: Use undulations and shimmies to engage deep abdomina
 l muscles for a tighter\, stronger midsection.\n\n• Functional Stability
 : Improve your balance and posture through controlled\, hip-driven moveme
 nts and low-impact aerobic footwork.\n\n• Total Body Toning: Build lean
  muscle in your legs\, glutes\, and arms while maintaining a constant\, he
 art-pumping pace.\n\n• Mind-Body Connection: Enhance your coordination 
 and body awareness through rhythmic\, expressive choreography.\n\n“Wheth
 er you’re looking to define your waistline or simply want a workout that
  feels like a celebration\, this class offers the perfect balance of sweat
  and grace.”\n\nDifficulty Level: All levels welcome! No prior dance ex
 perience is required—just bring your energy and a willingness to move.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
