  1\, 6:00 PM: Sebastopol City Council\, 3 seats\n\nHear directly from cand
 idates in Sonoma County and ask your own questions live\, all on Zoom. Hos
 ted by the League of Women Voters of Sonoma County.\n\nFind your city's fo
 rum on our event calendar at lwvsonoma.org for Zoom webinar links and deta
 ils. Click the event on the calendar for full details.\n\nAll forums will 
 be posted to our YouTube channel after each forum.\n\nAll Sonoma County fo
 rums\n\nMon\, Sept 28\, 6:00 PM: Sonoma City Council\, District 1\n\nTue\,
