  City Council\, District 2\n\nWed\, Oct 7\, 6:00 PM: Santa Rosa City Counc
 il\, District 4\n\nThu\, Oct 8\, 6:00 PM: Rohnert Park City Council\, Dist
 ricts 2 and 5\n\nAlso check out these forums from our partners this Octobe
 r: • KRCB\, local broadcasts of Sonoma County Supervisor forums • AAUW
