BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/cuban-salsa/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Cuban Salsa Beginner - 4-Week Class
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T203000
UID:260914wLj0AVAZ0UiEm-UuAXdY1A
DESCRIPTION:Cuban Salsa Class with Eric Celestino & Abigail Celestino\n\n4
 week class\n\nOctober 1 – October 22\n\nClass requires a minimum of 8 re
 gistrations to run. Please register soon so we can secure the session!\n\n
 This is a beginner cuban salsa—you will learn your basic footwork and tu
 rns.\n\nIn this class\, you will learn the fundamentals of Cuban Salsa\, i
 ncluding body movement\, rhythm\, musicality\, footwork\, partner connecti
 on\, and partnerwork patterns inspired by authentic Cuban dance culture. W
 e focus on proper technique\, coordination\, flow\, and natural body expre
 ssion\, while also building confidence and strong foundations.\n\nClasses 
 are structured with:\n\n• Warm-up and body movement\n\n• Footwork and 
 rhythm exercises\n\n• Partnerwork technique\n\n• Short combinations an
 d practical applications\n\nOur goal is to help you understand how to danc
 e salsa\, not just memorize steps — developing timing\, connection\, and
  a comfortable\, joyful way of dancing.\n\nCome dance with us\, grow your 
 technique\, and experience the energy and flavor of Cuba in a supportive a
 nd welcoming environment.\n\nBook your spot\n\nDate & Time:\n\n4week class
 \, October 1 – October 22\n\nThursdays @ 7:30 PM\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwoo
 d Highway \\#8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 minutes before. No floor
  marking shoe soles allowed.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/cuban-salsa/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/slave-play-a-left-edge-theatre-production/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Slave Play - a Left Edge Theatre Production
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T213000
UID:260924E1yxhy1VL0y_iPbhlz0krQ
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Left Edge Theatre. At the MacGregor Plantation\, 
 the antebellum South collides with the present in a provocative fever drea
 m where race\, desire\, gender\, and power intertwine. Nothing is quite as
  it seems-and yet everything is. Jeremy O. Harris's explosive\, award-winn
 ing Slave Play rips apart the boundaries between history and modern Americ
 a\, confronting the enduring legacy of slavery and the complex intersectio
 ns of race\, gender\, and sexuality. Recommended for ages 17\\+. Contains 
 nudity\, sexual content\, simulated sexual violence\, and racially violent
  language. TICKETS ZONE A \\(Close to the action\\) $45 ZONE B \\(Middle o
 f the house\\) $35 ZONE C \\(In the back\\) $25 Tickets at Door - $45 - So
  buy in advance! SPECIAL DATES Thu 9/25: OPENING NIGHT & PARTY - Stick aro
 und to celebrate after the show! Wed 9/30: Industry Night - Calling all th
 eatre people! All tickets $20. Thur 10/1: Discount night - $10 off all tic
 kets Advance purchase strongly encouraged.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/slave-play-a-left-edge-theatre-produc
 tion/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://signup.com/go/WiniixA"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Gain Speaking Confidence with Mare Island Toastmasters
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261001T203000
UID:2609160K_vp-QNH0e72HT4fhKOeQ
DESCRIPTION:We meet in-person only on the 1st and 2nd Thursdays of the mon
 th. However\, you can catch us online every Thursday unless the meeting da
 te falls on a holiday.\n\nPlease register at https://signup.com/go/WiniixA
 \n\nWhat is Toastmasters About?\n\nUsually at our meetings\, we will have 
 a prepared speech\, and a speech evaluation. The Grammarian and Wizard of 
 Ah's will listen for turns of phrases and the use of filler words. We also
  practice impromptu speaking during the section of the meeting called Tabl
 e Topics. During Table Topics\, at a recent meeting\, we were asked what w
 e felt was the biggest communication problem or challenge. What would you 
 answer in a fast moment? Table topics will challenge you to think quickly 
 and give an answer without preparation.\n\nYou will also hear tips on publ
 ic speaking skills at our upcoming meeting. Whether you're a seasoned trav
 eler or just looking for some adventure from the comfort of your home\, th
 is event is perfect for you.\n\nToastmasters International is all about co
 mmunication excellence\, and for 100 years and counting\, Toastmasters hav
 e been expressing themselves better\, practicing\, and evaluating in a fun
  club environment\, shining all around the world.\n\nTo find out more--Msg
  us on our webpage \\(under Contact Us\\) button at\n\nhttps://mareisland.
 toastmastersclubs.org/\n\nIf you will join us in-person on the first or se
 cond Thursday of the month\, we meet this week at Kaiser Hospital Bldg. A.
  3rd floor meeting room. When you enter the hospital building\, go past th
 e piano to the elevator. Go to the 3rd floor. Exit left out of the elevato
 r and left at the hall. Go past the gym and take a left at the hall. Walk 
 down the long hall to the meeting room.
URL:https://signup.com/go/WiniixA
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
