BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar Livewhale": "https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23851-from-sheep-to-loom-dine-weaving-traditions"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_livewhale
SUMMARY:From Sheep to Loom: Diné Weaving Traditions
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261002
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTSTAMP:20260827T095351Z
UID:20261002T070000Z-23851@calendar.santarosa.edu
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20261002
ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/src_region/0,0,567,567/695_cs_-_sheep_to_loom_2.rev.1787849613.png
CATEGORIES:Museum
DESCRIPTION:For the Diné\, weaving is considered a ceremony. Creating a s
 ingle blanket requires many steps\, including shearing the sheep\, cleanin
 g\, carding\, spinning\, and dyeing the wool\, and then finally weaving. I
 t can take hundreds of hours. This exhibit features rugs from the SRJC Mul
 ticultural Museum's collections\, featuring award winning woven rugs such 
 as a fine "Burntwater" style rug by the great Nellie Roan and many other e
 xamples of Navajo rugs from the 1920s through the 1970s.More information a
 vailable on the SRJC Multicultural Museum website. (https://museum.santaro
 sa.edu/)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T165351Z
LOCATION:SRJC Multicultural Museum - Santa Rosa Campus
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23851-from-sheep-to-loom-dine-wea
 ving-traditions
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  For the Diné\, weaving is considered a 
 ceremony. Creating a single blanket requires many steps\, including sheari
 ng the sheep\, cleaning\, carding\, spinning\, and dyeing the wool\, and t
 hen finally weaving. It can take hundreds of hours. This exhibit features 
 rugs from the SRJC Multicultural Museum's collections\, featuring award wi
 nning woven rugs such as a fine "Burntwater" style rug by the great Nellie
  Roan and many other examples of Navajo rugs from the 1920s through the 19
 70s.</p><p><a href="https://museum.santarosa.edu/" target="_blank" rel="no
 opener">More information available on the SRJC Multicultural Museum websit
 e.</a></p>
X-LIVEWHALE-ALL-DAY:1
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:23851
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80
 /height/80/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,567\,567/695_cs_-_sheep_to_loom_2.rev.1
 787849613.png
