DESCRIPTION:The Kyle Hyland Foundation for Teen Support is hosting the KHF
  10th Annual Charity Golf Tournament on Oct 2\, 2026 at Blue Rock Springs 
 Golf Course in Vallejo. Registration is at 7AM with shotgun start at 8AM. 
 Format is best ball. Prizes will be awarded for lowest team score\, longes
 t drive and closest to the pin. Optional putting contest will also be offe
 red. On course lunch will be served as well as appetizers at award ceremon
 y at the 19th hole. This is our biggest fundraiser of the year and we are 
 seeking sponsors for the tournament as well as donations for our silent au
 ction. More information is available on our website at the link above.\n\n
 Proceeds will benefit KHF teen programs including the Hyland Teen Center\,
  free teen counseling program and enrichment day trips.
