 iction\, mysteries\, sci-fi\, romance\, literature\, children's books\, hi
 story\, Californiana\, biographies/memoirs\, art\, music \\(including shee
 t music\\)\, cooking\, health/medicine\, religion\, psychology\, sociology
 /anthropology\, performing arts\, languages\, travel\, poetry and more.\n\
 nHOURS:\n\n- Friday\, Oct 2 from 1 - 3 pm Members-only Preview \\(individu
 al memberships start at $10\; available at the door starting at noon\\). O
 pen to the public Friday\, Oct 2 from 3 - 7pm\n\n- Saturday\, Oct 3 10 am 
 - 5 pm\n\n- Sunday\, Oct 4 HALF-PRICE DAY 10 am - 4 pm\n\n- Monday\, Oct 5
  $5/BAG DAY 2 - 6 pm \\(no limit on number of grocery-sized bags\\)\n\nLOC
 ATION: Veterans Memorial Hall\, 1351 Maple Avenue\, Santa Rosa. Free parki
 ng on site.\n\nPAYMENT: Credit\, debit\, cash\, check and Apple\, Google &
  Samsung Pay\n\n HOSTED BY FRIENDS OF THE SANTA ROSA LIBRARIES \\(sonomal
 ibrary.org/friends\\). Proceeds benefit Santa Rosa Libraries. See our ad i
 n BOOKSALEFINDER.COM and Like us on Facebook \\(Friends of the Santa Rosa 
