  Mafia performance.\n\nFrom *Yesterday* to *Come Together*\, *Something* t
 o *Across the Universe*\, songs you’ve known for a lifetime are transfor
 med into something unexpected\, alive\, and made for right now.\n\nArrive 
 early for the **pre-party at 6 PM**\, then settle in as the main performan
 ce takes the stage from **7–10 PM**.\n\n**Date & Time**\n\n**Friday\, Oc
 tober 2\, 2026**\n\nPre-Party · 6 PM\n\nMain Show · 7–10 PM\n\n**Come 
