BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://safariwest.com/calendar/safari-west-pconservation-works/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Safari West Presents! Conservation Works
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T203000
UID:260131Zdv3m74nYUuooLd6YNAHJw
DESCRIPTION:Conservation Dinner Series: Oona Heacock of  Conservation Work
 s joins us in the elephant room after dinner to give a talk about bees. Th
 e conservation dinner series is complimentary to all dinner guests. If you
  want to attend this presentation\, please call our reservations team at \
 \(707\\) 566-3667 or \\(800\\) 616-2695 and they can book it for you. Dinn
 er starts at 7:00 PM. About the Speaker:    Oona is the Assistant Executiv
 e Director at Conservation Works - formally the North Coast Resource Conse
 rvation and Development Council \\(NCRC&DC\\)\, a small nonprofit that wor
 ks with youth and the community to support sustainable agriculture in the 
 North Bay. A conservationist and educator by practice and geologist by tra
 de she has felt fortunate to be involved in work\, which combines her pass
 ion to address our communities most pressing conservation challenges while
  empowering youth to foster sustainable and regenerative practices for the
  future. Oona has been leading the Bee Patches Environmental Education pro
 gram at Conservation Works for over five years and has worked with hundred
 s of youth volunteers to design and plant "Bee Patch" pollinator habitats 
 along our local Sonoma County ranches\, vineyards and farms with the goal 
 of healthy pollinator habitat being embraced at all levels of our communit
 y. She enjoys sharing her knowledge about the beauty and diversity of our 
 precious bees and the important ecosystem services they provide while enga
 ging youth to work together to make a difference to protect this furry lit
 tle wildlife. She holds a B.S. in Geology and is currently pursuing her Ma
 sters in Public Administration at Sonoma State University.
LOCATION:Safari West
URL:https://safariwest.com/calendar/safari-west-pconservation-works/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://mercywellness.com/tokes-n-jokes-comedy-night", "Press Democrat": "https://mercywellness.com/tokes-n-jokes-comedy-night"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://mercywellness.com/tokes-n-jokes-comedy-night"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Mercy Presents: Last Mic Standing Comedy Showdown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T220000
UID:260701_bRhHhnGu0-l4T6Qrzj3dg
DESCRIPTION:Battle for the Main Stage.\n\nEight fearless comics step into 
 the spotlight for one night of rapid-fire punchlines\, crowd reactions\, a
 nd high-stakes humor inside The Lounge at Mercy.\n\nThis isn’t an open m
 ic. This is a showdown.\n\n8 Comics. 3 Judges. Audience Vote.\n\nEach come
 dian brings their sharpest material and strongest stage presence to compet
 e for the title of Last Mic Standing. Judges score the sets. The crowd wei
 ghs in. The energy decides everything.\n\nOne night. One winner.\n\nThe st
 akes are real. The winner takes home a $100 cash prize and earns a paid ho
 sting spot at the next Mercy’s Tokes & Jokes Comedy Night. Win the crowd
 . Own the mic. Come back as host.\n\nThis is a 420-friendly comedy competi
 tion hosted inside our fully licensed cannabis consumption lounge\, where 
 elevated vibes meet elevated punchlines. Guests are welcome to enjoy respo
 nsibly while comics go head-to-head under the lights. Great sets hit diffe
 rently here.\n\nDate & Time\n\nDate: First Friday of Every Month\n\nTime: 
 8:00 PM – 9:30 PM\n\nDoors Open: 6:00 PM\n\nTicket Tiers\n\n$20 — Gene
 ral Admission \\(Open Seating\\) Entry to Comedy Showdown 🎤 Open seatin
 g \\(first come\, first served\\). Come early for the best spot.\n\n$30 
 — GA \\+ Goodie Bag A little extra ✨ Entry \\+ goodie bag \\($15 value
 \\) included. Open seating \\(first come\, first served\\). \n\n⭐ $40 
 — Preferred Bucket Seat \\+ Goodie Bag \\(Most Popular\\) Comfort upgrad
 e ⭐ Guaranteed bucket seat \\+ shared table access\, plus goodie bag \\(
 $15 value\\) included. Limited seating.\n\n🔥 $135 — Couch Crew Pass \
 \(3 Guests \\+ Premium Bag\\) Bring your crew 🔥 Includes admission for 
 3 guests\, reserved couch seating with a dedicated table\, plus premium ba
 g \\($100 value\\) included. Only 11 couches.\n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-
 0000420-LIC\n\nEvent Terms & Conditions\n\nThis event is 21\\+ only. Valid
  government-issued ID is required for entry. By attending this event at th
 e Mercy Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge that photography and video recor
 ding may take place. Images and footage may be used by Mercy Wellness for 
 marketing and promotional purposes across various channels\, without compe
 nsation. Tickets are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event details
 \, timing\, or programming are subject to change.\n\nCannabis consumption 
 is limited to designated areas and must comply with all applicable local a
 nd state regulations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venue
 \, you agree to comply with all house rules and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://mercywellness.com/tokes-n-jokes-comedy-night
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
