SUMMARY: Take the art of Still Life to new places
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Sandra Novia\n\nDates: Fridays\, ongoing\, throug
 h October 2nd.\n\nTime: 2:30pm - 4:30pm.\n\nLocation : Santa Rosa Store\n
 \nFee: $310 for 6 classes. Please check with instructor for details.\n\n\
 n\nThis class is for art explorers of all levels!\n\nCreating a still lif
 e is about waking up your observational skills. Moving through different 
 mediums\, we will embark on a journey together\, exploring how to apply m
 any art forms and techniques to express what you see in life.\n\nIn this 
 six week course\, each class will explore a different art medium. We will
  draw and paint with graphite\, watercolor pencils and acrylic. We will e
 xpand on those mediums as we move into printmaking\, collage\, and mosaic
  to bring your art to life. It's a great class to learn the fundamentals 
 for beginners and for experienced artists that want to try their hand at 
 a new art form you haven't done before.\n\nAll levels Welcomed.\n\nLet's 
 explore the beautiful art of expressing Art together.\n\n\nTo register fo
 r this series\, please contact Sandra Novia at: (707) 433-ARTS (2787)\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Mixed-Media
