BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://about.bankofamerica.com/en/making-an-impact/museums-on-us-partners"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Napa Valley Museum Yountville FREE Oct 3-4 Bank of America Museums
  on Us
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T160000
UID:260925XeDIa9cVzEKesOMiUJeffg
DESCRIPTION:Bank of America cardholders receive free general admission to 
 participating museums nationwide on the first full weekend of each month\;
  this month is October 3-4. \n\nAs a chill settles in the air\, Halloween
  costumes are planned\, and leaves crunch on the ground\, take a moment th
 is busy fall season to enjoy a very special exhibit in your own backyard! 
 The Napa Valley Museum Yountville has exciting exhibits including Mary Bla
 ir: Mid-Century Magic\, a special exhibition by the Walt Disney Family Mus
 eum exploring the creative vision and achievements of one of Walt Disney
 ’s most imaginative and renowned designers and art directors. Mary’s w
 ork appeared in classic Disney animated films like Cinderella (1950)\, Ali
 ce in Wonderland (1951)\, and Peter Pan (1953). The exhibit closes October
  25\, 2026\, so it might be your last chance to make it before it’s gone
 !\n\nBank of America Museums on Us program offers FREE weekend general adm
 ission on the first full weekend of every month to Bank of America\, Merri
 ll and Bank of America Private Bank credit and debit cardholders. All you 
 need is your Bank of America\, Merrill\, or Bank of America Private Bank c
 ard and picture ID for access. \n\nAdditional participating museums can b
 e found here: https://about.bankofamerica.com/en/making-an-impact/museums-
 on-us-partner
LOCATION:Napa Valley Museum Yountville
URL:https://about.bankofamerica.com/en/making-an-impact/museums-on-us-part
 ners
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/", "Press Democrat": "https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Maple Magic & Winter Wonder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T170000
UID:260824HazYPNIaHEyrm_-LVQl-6g
DESCRIPTION:As the days grow shorter and cooler\, Sonoma Botanical Garden 
 transforms with the beauty of the changing seasons. From the first signs o
 f autumn in October to the brilliant display of rare Asian maples in Nov
 ember and the quiet beauty of early winter in December\, each visit offer
 s something new to discover. \n\nMaple Magic & Winter Wonder invites vis
 itors to experience this special time of year through nature\, creativity\
 , and connection. Throughout the season\, the Garden offers guided walks\,
  hands-on workshops\, lectures\, and special experiences inspired by the c
 hanging landscape. Wander among vibrant fall foliage\, breathe in the swee
 t fragrance of katsura trees\, enjoy creative programs\, and experience th
 e peaceful beauty of the Garden as it transitions into winter.
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://sonomabg.org/visit/maple-magic-winter-wonder/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-beginners-saturday/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Salsa Beginner Marin – Saturday
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T110000
UID:260317uLrONzeuUUWkiejd6hSjGw
DESCRIPTION:**Ready to learn intermediate steps and technique?** Join on 
 on Saturday – Salsa Beginner Marin\n\nAre you a beginner who’s always 
 wanted to learn salsa? Salsa classes are designed to help you build a stro
 ng foundation. In this class\, you’ll learn the fundamental footwork\, p
 ractice the basic turns\, and understand the essential body movement that 
 will make you feel confident on the dance floor. This class is perfect for
  anyone ready to learn the techniques and foundational steps needed to sta
 rt their salsa journey.\n\nSalsa is fun\, and we make learning it stress-f
 ree! Our relaxed\, beginner-friendly class is the ideal starting point. Yo
 u don’t need a partner\, nor any dance experience!\n\nIn this class you 
 will learn:\n\nBasic directional steps that form the foundation of salsa.\
 n\nProper frame for comfortable and effective partner-work.\n\nSimple\, ea
 sy-to-remember turn patterns.\n\nGet ready to learn the fundamentals and h
 ave a great time!\n\n**Details:**\n\n**No partner necessary**—rotations 
 ensure everyone dances\n\nPlease wear **non-marking shoes** to protect t
 he floor\n\nArrive 10 minutes early\; warm up and settle in\n\n**When:** 
 Saturday\, 10:00 am – 11:00 am\n\n**Where:** 4140 Redwood Highway #8\, 
 San Rafael\, CA
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8\, San Rafael\, CA
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-beginners-saturday/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
