DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T150000
UID:260921_yIJIHGq0USrYqhIHY5GDw
DESCRIPTION:Chocolatier Sarah Cain of Spirited Sweets Chocolates is proud 
 to announce her upcoming Haunted Chocolate Cottage Workshop\, hosted at An
 chor Pantry. This is the first of her hands-on seasonal sessions to help h
 oliday enthusiasts and dessert lovers learn the art of edible architecture
  through expert guidance and festive design techniques. No experience is n
 ecessary.\n\nWhy wait until the winter holidays to build your own festive 
 centerpiece? Do it now! Celebrate the spooky season with edible art!
LOCATION:Alibi Bookshop
URL:https://www.spiritedsweetschocolates.com/product-page/haunted-chocolat
 e-house-workshop-sunday-10-15-2023
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107954611?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=287&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event"}
