DESCRIPTION:Head to Santa Rosa for mini train rides with Redwood Empire Li
 ve Steamers! Trains run in Youth Community Park \\(across from Piner High 
 School\\) the first weekend of the month\, May-October\, weather permittin
 g. Rides are free\, but donations are greatly appreciated and help keep th
 e trains running. The park has a great playground and picnic areas so come
  up and make a day of it!
LOCATION:Youth Community Park
URL:https://www.marinmommies.com/calendar/redwood-empire-live-steamers
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
