DESCRIPTION:The Psychic Fair is back! As per usual\, we will have readings
 \, book signings\, hourly raffle prizes\, and a whole lotta witchy fun! Th
 e event starts at NOON\, all tarot readings will be 10 minutes and cost $2
 0. Readings will end at 6pm\, so don't wait too long to get in line! Ticke
 ts for readings can be purchased at Milk & Honey the day of the event. The
 re is no limit to the amount of readings you can get! Try out as many read
 ers as you'd like. Come on by and get your Samhain energy going. Feel free
  to bring a picture or memento of your Beloved Dead for our Ancestor Altar
 .
