DESCRIPTION:Grab your flannel and dust off your Docs! Midlife Riot is a Sa
 n Rafael\, California-based 5-piece bringing the best of 90s alternative r
 ock back to life.\n\nFeaturing veteran musicians from across the Bay Area\
 , the band delivers a high-energy set packed with the songs that defined a
  generation.\n\nFrom Green Day and Blink-182 to Oasis\, Weezer\, Gin Bloss
 oms\, and Nirvana\, Midlife Riot plays the soundtrack of your mixtape year
 s: loud\, nostalgic\, and impossible not to sing along to.
LOCATION:Old Western Saloon
