SUMMARY:THE ED EARLEY BAND –  Soulful Blues
DESCRIPTION:ED EARLEY BAND\n \nEd Earley is the legendary long time trombone player for the legendary Elvin Bishop Band. He has played with such historic talent as not only Elvin Bishop but Albert King and John Lee Hooker.\nEd Earley offers up his own band’s sass and style for your listening and dancing pleasure.\nThis dynamic group of exceptionally talented musicians are all fabulous performers in their own right\, and Ed has brought them together in a way that cannot be resisted … come see the Best of the Best!
