DESCRIPTION:HUGE Book Sale: 50\,000 gently used books\, DVDs\, CDs\, vinyl
 \, sheet music\, puzzles and more at bargain prices.\n\n- Most books\, DVD
 s\, CDs $2. Most children’s books and vinyl $1\, plus high-quality\, har
 d-to-find collectible and gift books\, boxed sets\, jigsaw puzzles\, games
  and journals priced as marked.\n\n- 50\\+ categories of books including f
 iction\, mysteries\, sci-fi\, romance\, literature\, children's books\, hi
 story\, Californiana\, biographies/memoirs\, art\, music \\(including shee
 t music\\)\, cooking\, health/medicine\, religion\, psychology\, sociology
 /anthropology\, performing arts\, languages\, travel\, poetry and more.\n\
