SUMMARY:Soundcheck Music + Wine feat. Tropa Magica\, Spacemoth & Christina's Trip
DESCRIPTION:  \nAt Gundlach Bundschu\, we’ve always believed that the best memories happen after the bottle is opened. This October\, we’re bringing that spirit to life in a new way – and you’re officially invited! \nJoin us on Sunday October 4th for the inaugural Soundcheck\, a brand-new daytime live music event. For one afternoon\, we’re transforming the Rhinefarm into an immersive concert experience\, with live music at our Amphitheater stage\, DJ sets\, local food trucks\, wine tasting experiences\, and plenty to discover between performances. \nThis year’s concert will feature Tropa Magica\, Spacemoth & Christina’s Trip. Soundcheck is all about discovering new music in an unforgettable setting – and you may just leave with a new favorite band… \nReserve your spot today and help us kick off what we hope becomes a favorite tradition for years to come. \nDATE: Sunday October 4th\, 2026 \nTIME: 2-7p \nLOCATION: Gundlach Bundschu Winery (Amphitheater\, Courtyard & Arbor Bar) \nTICKETS: Gundlach Bundschu or Abbot’s Passage Club member price $35. Public $55pp. Guests under 10 are free to attend. \nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/bacchus-club-soundcheck-concert/
LOCATION:Gundlach Bundschu Winery\, 2000 Denmark St\, Sonoma\, 95476\, United States
CATEGORIES:Concert,Winery Event,Local,Bacchus Club
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/SOUNDCHECK-POSTER-8_20_2026-2.png
GEO:38.2751233;-122.4255305
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=DESCRIPTION:  \nAt Gundlach Bundschu we’ve always believed that the best memories happen after the bottle is opened. This October we’re bringing that spirit to life in a new way – and you’re officially invited! \nJoin us on Sunday October 4th for the inaugural Soundcheck a brand-new daytime live music event. For one afternoon we’re transforming the Rhinefarm into an immersive concert experience with live music at our Amphitheater stage DJ sets local food trucks wine tasting experiences and plenty to discover between performances. \nThis year’s concert will feature Tropa Magica Spacemoth & Christina’s Trip. Soundcheck is all about discovering new music in an unforgettable setting – and you may just leave with a new favorite band… \nReserve your spot today and help us kick off what we hope becomes a favorite tradition for years to come. \nDATE: Sunday October 4th 2026 \nTIME: 2-7p \n Gundlach Bundschu Winery (Amphitheater Courtyard & Arbor Bar) \nTICKETS: Gundlach Bundschu or Abbot’s Passage Club member price $35. Public $55pp. Guests under 10 are free to attend. \nBUY TICKETS;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2000 Denmark St:geo:-122.4255305,38.2751233
