X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:KHS Mural Making Meeting @3:15pm
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T000000
UID:260424EabKzSXy5EmuYQuHul9tlw
DESCRIPTION:Hi everyone\,\n\nQuick reminder about our mural meeting.\n\nWe
 'll start arranging our drawings and ideas together\, imagining how the tu
 le\, hitch\, lake\, mountains\, and other elements might live and flow acr
 oss the wall as one connected mural.\n\nAlso\, if you haven't already\, pl
 ease join our Band group! It's where we'll share updates\, reminders\, and
  information about the mural project. You may need to download the Band ap
 p if you don't already have it.\n\nClick here to join:\n\nMonday's ⏰ 3:1
