DESCRIPTION:Big hearts. Busy hands. Jewish kids making a difference\n\nThi
 s year\, we're putting a special emphasis on hands-on mitzvahs. Kids won't
  just learn about Jewish values—they'll put them into action!\n\nAt Club
  Kindness\, we'll brighten someone's day\, care for those in need\, explor
 e Ahavat Yisrael\, show kindness to animals and care for the world around 
 us—discovering along the way just how much good even little hands can do
 .\n\nAnd we'll still bake\, build\, create\, taste and celebrate our way t
 hrough the Jewish year\, experiencing holidays and traditions in ways kids
  can see\, touch and do.\n\nJudaism comes to life\, one mitzvah at a time!
