X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group": "https://www.meetup.com/the-santa-rosa-spiritual-experiences-group/events/316715442/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_the_santa_rosa_spiritual_experiences_group
X-SOURCE:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group
UID:event_316715442@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045613Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T201500
SUMMARY:Nurturing Good Choices
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\nWe're faced with c
 hoices everyday. Can becoming more aware of the choices we make help us re
 spond to life in a more harmonious and uplifting way? **The choice is ours
 .**\n\n"We are a state of consciousness. Everyone and everything in our pe
 rsonal life and universal world has an effect upon us. We want to become a
 ware of what these effects are. Then we can sort through them\, nurturing 
 the good ones and discarding the bad."— Harold Klemp *[The Loving Heart]
 (https://www.amazon.com/Loving-Heart-Immortality-Soul-ebook/dp/B0CBNMP8JZ/
 ref=ast_sto_dp_puis "https://www.amazon.com/Loving-Heart-Immortality-Soul-
 ebook/dp/B0CBNMP8JZ/ref=ast_sto_dp_puis")\,* p. 100\n\nBy tapping into our
  own inner resource\, Divine Spirit\, we can learn to:\n\n* **Nurture** be
 tter choices\n* **Move through** challenging events with Grace\n* **Raise*
 * our state of consciousness\n\nJoin this spiritual exploration about what
  to nurture and what to discard in our lives — with choices that come up
  everyday or once in a lifetime.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/the-santa-rosa-spiritual-experiences-
 group/events/316715442/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260925T212802Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260925T212802Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
