X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://artescapesonoma.jumbula.com/Fall2026/CeramicCarvingPiePlates", "Press Democrat": "https://artescapesonoma.jumbula.com/Fall2026/CeramicCarvingPiePlates"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://artescapesonoma.jumbula.com/Fall2026/CeramicCarvingPiePlates"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Ceramic Carving - Pie Plates
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T203000
UID:260828ujtBlXFGaEW9jliDw54--g
DESCRIPTION:Join Kelly from No Peach Ceramics for this special ceramic car
 ving class. \n\nCreate a one-of-a-kind ceramic pie plate just in time for
  the holiday baking season! Learn decorative carving techniques as you per
 sonalize a handcrafted pie plate with patterns\, festive designs\, and bea
 utiful glazes for a functional heirloom you'll enjoy for years to come.\n\
 nSgraffito is an ancient technique of surface decoration that involves scr
 atching or carving through a layer to reveal a contrasting color beneath. 
 During the course of this 3-hour workshop\, we will cover the fundamentals
  of which tools and techniques to best apply \\(and then remove\\) slips a
 nd underglazes to a pre-prepared clay "canvas". Demonstrations of when and
  how to carve successfully will be supplemented with in-depth advice on ea
 ch aspect of the sgraffito process. \n\n All experience levels are welco
 me! You will be provided with materials\, tools\, and forms to practice sg
 raffito and make your own unique platter. Bringing inspiration photos and 
 design ideas is welcomed and encouraged! We will be providing one pre-prep
 ared raw clay platter per student to use during the course. After the clas
 s\, we will fire your finished piece and it will be ready to pick up withi
 n 2-3 weeks.
LOCATION:Art Escape Sonoma
URL:https://artescapesonoma.jumbula.com/Fall2026/CeramicCarvingPiePlates
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
