SUMMARY:Candidate Forum for Rohnert Park City Council by LWV
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T180000
UID:260919giDhfO3wyki60X_xv8DRvw
DESCRIPTION:Election day is right around the corner\, and it's not always 
 easy to get information about who's on the ballot. Learn who is running fo
 r city council and other local offices in your city by watching a candidat
 e forum.\n\nThu\, Oct 8\, 6:00 PM: Rohnert Park City Council\, Districts 2
  and 5\n\nHear directly from candidates in Sonoma County and ask your own 
 questions live on Zoom. Hosted by the League of Women Voters of Sonoma Cou
 nty\, a nonpartisan\, nonprofit organization dedication to voter education
 .\n\nFind your city's forum on our event calendar at lwvsonoma.org for Zoo
 m webinar links and details. Click the event on the calendar for full deta
 ils. All forums will be posted to our YouTube channel after each forum.\n\
 nAll Sonoma County forums\n\nMon\, Sept 28\, 6:00 PM: Sonoma City Council\
 , District 1\n\nTue\, Sept 29\, 6:00 PM: Cloverdale City Council\, 3 seats
 \n\nWed\, Sept 30\, 6:00 PM: Windsor Mayor and Town Council\, District 1\n
 \nThu\, Oct 1\, 6:00 PM: Sebastopol City Council\, 3 seats\n\nMon\, Oct 5\
 , 7:15 PM: Healdsburg City Council\, District 2\n\nWed\, Oct 7\, 6:00 PM: 
 Santa Rosa City Council\, District 4\n\nThu\, Oct 8\, 6:00 PM: Rohnert Par
 k City Council\, Districts 2 and 5\n\nAlso check out these forums from our
  partners this October: • KRCB\, for local broadcasts of Sonoma County S
 upervisor forums • AAUW Petaluma\, for Petaluma Mayor and City Council f
 orums
URL:https://www.lwvsonoma.org/content.aspx?page_id=4002&club_id=720180&ite
 m_id=3071682
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
