X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:THURSDAY NIGHTS ARE LIT (really lit\, new lighting) and Stage @ Th
 e Empress Marquee Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T180000
UID:260102V0j1T4rtn0OysfsSQ0E6FQ
DESCRIPTION:TONIGHT @ The Empress Marquee Club. https://www.tix.com/ticket
 -sales/empresstheatre/7268/event/1444117 The amazing Loralee Christensen h
 as been captivating audiences for over 30 years with a voice that’s as p
 owerful as it is versatile. Onstage and in the studio\, she seamlessly shi
 fts from the raw growl of Big Mama Thornton to the sultry smoothness of Ju
 lie London\, from the rock-edged fire of Linda Ronstadt to the tender warm
 th of Emmylou Harris. Her live performances have thrilled audiences across
  the U.S. and Europe—including standout appearances at Italy’s renowne
 d Porretta Soul Festival\, where she earned the nicknames “La Bionda Bom
 ba” \\(the blond bombshell\\) and “La Voce” \\(The Voice\\). A first
 -call studio singer\, Loralee has recorded for top producers and writers i
 n the country’s best studios. You’ve heard her on national campaigns f
 or Mazda\, Taco Bell\, Clorox\, Sunkist\, and Jello\, as well as on movie 
 soundtracks like Rent\, Celine Dion’s A Decade of Song\, and Sony Playst
 ation 2’s Karaoke Revolution – American Idol. Critics and peers have p
 raised her artistry: “Loralee’s voice is the embodiment of her spirit
 … big\, lusty\, and filled with love. She is a force of nature.” — J
 effrey Cohen\, Keller & Cohen “Her songs stroll through blues\, country\
 , rock and originals… wouldn’t be surprised if Janis Joplin or Sister 
 Rosetta Tharpe dropped her a hint through the heavens.” — Jean Bartlet
 t\, The Mercury News “Soul-singer\, rock goddess\, stylist\, personality
  that blows through your speakers forcing you to listen—all of these are
  Loralee.” — Stephony Smith\, BMI Songwriter of the Year
LOCATION:Empress Theatre
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1357664949338143/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
