DESCRIPTION:Teaching Artist: Hannah DayDate: Saturday\, October 10\, 2026T
 ime: 10:00am-3:00pm In this one-day workshop\, participants will slow down
  and take a close-up look at the beautiful trees of Jack London State Park
 . We’ll explore the fascinating details found up close—bark\, moss\, k
 nots\, cracks\, textures\, patterns\, and the subtle variations in color a
 nd light that make each tree unique. Students will spend time observing an
 d drawing aspects of the trees around them while learning and practicing f
 oundati
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park\, 2400 London Ranch Road\, Glen E
 llen\, CA 95442
