SUMMARY:Derek Irving: Rockabilly Duo\, Little Big Band\, Combo
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T103000
UID:251113O1txSgSlTk2cC3t_ORhajw
DESCRIPTION:Derek Irving channels the raw\, unfiltered spirit of early roc
 k ’n’ roll\, blending the swagger of 1950s rockabilly with the driving
  rhythms of 1960s surf and rhythm & blues. The band’s sound is a nod to 
 pioneers like Chuck Berry\, Eddie Cochran\, and Carl Perkins\, but it does
 n’t stop there—there’s the grit of Bo Diddley\, the twang of Link Wr
 ay\, and a dash of reverb-soaked surf guitar straight out of a California 
 beach party.\n\nAt the heart of every show is Derek’s fiery guitar work
 —snarling riffs\, wild bends\, and rapid-fire picking that harken back t
 o rock ’n’ roll’s golden age. Anchoring the groove is the slap and t
 hump of upright bass\, a rhythmic heartbeat that gets crowds moving and ke
 eps the energy rolling from the first chord to the last encore.\n\nThis is
 n’t just a throwback—it’s a high-octane revival of the roots of rock
  ’n’ roll\, delivered with a modern edge that pulls fans of all ages o
 nto the dance floor. Whether it’s a winery crowd\, a festival stage\, or
  a late-night club\, Derek Irving and his band ignite every room with a so
 und that’s timeless\, electric\, and impossible to stand still to.
LOCATION:Downtown Novato Center
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107552137?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
