 true pioneer of house music and the creator of the legendary **Mushroom Ja
 zz** sound\, **MARK FARINA** takes over the Mystic Theatre on **Saturday\,
  October 10!**\n\nGet ready for a seamless journey through deep house\, ja
 zzy grooves\, hip-hop-infused beats and dance-floor energy from one of ele
 ctronic music’s most celebrated DJs.\n\nCome early and plan to dance all
  night! 🔊✨\n\n**MARK FARINA** 📅 Saturday\, October 10 🚪 Doors &
