DESCRIPTION:<pJoin Battaglini Wines for their  Harvest and Stomp a day fil
 led with Italian heritage\, old-world winemaking traditions\, community\, 
 and fun. Guests can enjoy a memorable harvest celebration in the heart of 
 wine country\, filled with laughter and time-honored traditions. Experienc
 e the passion and craftsmanship behind Battaglini Wines while celebrating 
 the season with friends\, family\, and fellow wine lovers. To reserve your
  spot\, email Battaglini Wines or call \\(707\\) 318-8944.
