BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/bhakti-yoga-daytreat-st1d26/?lang=en", "Press Democrat": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/bhakti-yoga-daytreat-st1d26/?lang=en"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/bhakti-yoga-daytreat-st1d26/?lang=en"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Bhakti Yoga Daytreat
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T170000
UID:260820CD9BteEX-U6G0DZ71Dnwsg
DESCRIPTION:with Janet Stone\n\nIn a world of constant noise\, this day is
  an invitation to return to the wisdom beneath it—to pause\, listen deep
 ly\, and reconnect with the heart of who you are.\n\nThrough meditation\, 
 breath\, yoga\, chanting\, music\, storytelling\, contemplation\, time in 
 nature\, and rest\, we’ll nourish the nervous system while exploring the
  stories that shape our lives. Drawing from the wisdom of the *purāṇas
 * (sacred myths)\, we’ll gently inquire into the narratives we’ve inh
 erited\, the ones we’ve unconsciously repeated\, and the possibility of 
 living a story that is more awake\, courageous\, and true.\n\nBhakti—the
  yoga of the heart—reminds us that every emotion can become fuel for tra
 nsformation. Chanting is a love letter to life\, inviting us to offer our 
 voices to something greater while awakening our innate capacity for love\,
  grace\, resilience\, and devotion.\n\nJoin Janet Stone for a day of pract
 ice\, reflection\, community\, and stillness as we step away from the nois
 e and back toward ourselves.\n\nThis program will include a non-heated\, v
 igorous yoga asana practice.  In addition to the vigorous yoga asana pra
 ctice mentioned above\, our day together will involve a **long\, strenuou
 s hike** that includes steep sections of both uphill and downhill. You *
 *must be in good physical shape and not require any mobility assistance or
  devices**\, other than a typical trekking pole or stick for this program.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/bhakti-yoga-daytreat-s
 t1d26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.northbayoa.org/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.northbayoa.org/"}
