DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Bricoleur Vineyards'  8th Annual Harvest Party \, a 
 festive day of wine\, music\, community\, and family-friendly fun. Enjoy l
 awn games\, live music\, vineyard views\, local artisans\, and food and wi
 ne available for purchase. The admission fee supports cancer research as p
 art of Bricoleur's Sip with Purpose mission\, while children and guests un
 der 21 are admitted free. Well- Guests can also browse local vendors and a
 rtisans\, enjoy the beauty of the estate\, and Bricoleur Club members can 
 pick up their fall club shipment. Come raise a glass\, celebrate the bount
 y of harvest\, and give back to a meaningful cause.
