 rd setting as talented local musicians fill the air with great sound and g
 ood vibes. Enjoy delicious food for purchase\, Lasseter wines by the bottl
 e\, and a laid-back wine country experience that captures the spirit of Gl
 en Ellen. This event is the perfect blend of local flavor\, exceptional wi
 ne\, and scenic beauty.\n\nJune 14th: Live music by What the Folk and Wood
 -Fired Pizza by Chef Degen\n\nJuly 12th: Live music by Grey Fox Trio and F
 ood from S'Wine Country BBQ\n\nAugust 9th: Live music by Colin and Aubrey 
 McAdoo and Food from Loncheria\n\nSeptember 13th: Live music by Sean Carsc
