 members—and join us for: End Polio Now Torch Relay Dog Costume Parade & 
 Contest Pumpkin Painting for Kids Jumpy House Farmers Market Family-friend
 ly fall fun! DOG COSTUME CONTEST TROPHIES Overall Best Costume Spookiest C
 ostume ✨ Most Unique Costume Think your pup has what it takes to bring h
 ome a trophy? Dress them up and join the fun!  Want to enter your pet in t
 he parade and costume contest? Please contact Charlotte White for the appl
 ication and waiver no later than September 30th: cwhite@clearlake.ca.us \\
