UID:2607204byXnFALXEycu_58g6k4GQ
DESCRIPTION:**Golden Hour at Kosta Browne**\n\n**WHAT:** Golden Hour at Ko
 sta Browne\n\n**WHEN:**          Saturday\, August 8\n\nSaturday\
 , September 5\n\nSaturday\, October 10\n\n**TIME:**            
 3:30pm-5:30pm\n\n**WHERE:**       Kosta Browne Winery\n\n     
                    220 Morris Street\n\n        
                 Sebastopol\, CA 95472\n\n**LINK:**    
         https://www.exploretock.com/kostabrowne/experience/603315/g
 olden-hour-at-kosta-browne\n\n**DETAILS:** \n\nKosta Browne is opening the
 ir courtyard with wines by the glass. Enjoy that stretch of light that lin
 gers. See where the night takes you. It all begins here.\n\nKosta Browne c
 rafts Pinot Noir and Chardonnay from the wild edges of California’s coas
 t and the revered hillsides of Burgundy. The courtyard in Sebastopol’s B
 arlow is where those wines get opened.\n\n**ADMISSION:** Walk-ins welcome
LOCATION:Kosta Browne Winery 
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/kostabrowne/experience/603315/golden-hour-
 at-kosta-browne
