UID:260911fV0VEuy-Qk-sHyOH6372Rg
DESCRIPTION:**The Greek by Dino Moniodis | Mondays\, September 21–Octobe
 r 12 | Appellation Kitchen\, $85 per person**  For four Mondays this fall
 \, Appellation Kitchen is partnering with **Dino’s Greek Food Truck** to
  present The Greek\, a limited-time\, five course pop-up dinner series fro
 m chef Dino Moniodis. A Sonoma County native\, Moniodis spent his childhoo
 d summers in Greece working in his cousin’s beachfront restaurant\, and 
 now brings the food he grew up eating to Appellation Healdsburg. The exper
 ience will extend to the glass\, with a Greek-focused wine list curated by
  Folia’s sommelier Tess Housholder\, featuring her favorite dry whites f
 rom the region.  \n\nWhen: Mondays | September 21\, September 28\, Octob
 er 5\, October 12 (5:00 to 9:00 pm) \n\nPrice | $85 per guest\, Greek win
 es priced separately \n\nReservations are available through OpenTable: Th
 e Greek by Dino Moniodis \n\n*Walk-ins are welcome throughout the evening
 . The Appellation Kitchen menu remains available as well.*
LOCATION:Appellation Healdsburg
URL:https://www.foliabarandkitchen.com/event/the-greek-by-dino-moniodis/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
