 ecember 2\, 2026\n\n10:00 AM – 1:00 PM\n\nExceptions\n\nNo class Novembe
 r 11\, Veterans Day\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 117\, Ceramics Studio\n\nCategory\
 n\nCeramics\, Extended Classes\n\nExperience Level\n\nAdvanced\n\nAges\n\n
 17+\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$265\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$30\n\nTotal Regist
 ration Cost:\n\n$295\n\nThis session is designed for people who have alrea
 dy taken multiple wheel throwing courses. A continuation of our intermedia
 te course\, this upper level / advanced course will help you hone your thr
 owing skills through more complex demos\, and nuanced approaches to techni
 cal throwing. In this 8 week course\, students will dive deep into develop
 ing their own unique voice as they build a technical toolset for the indep
 endent maker. In addition to throwing\, surface decoration techniques will
  be explored as well as the opportunity to experiment with different clay 
 bodies.**With your 8 week class registration\, students receive the opport
 unity to purchase a studio pass for ½ off during the duration of their cl
 ass. Sign ups for membership will be included**
