 g a bit more time in the studio with Lynn Wood?** This session\, opt-in fo
 r and additional 1.5 hours of guided working time each class session in th
 e studio with Lynn Wood for an extra fee. Regularly scheduled class will o
 ccur from 10am-1pm\, and then our additional Guided Working Session with L
 ynn Wood will run from 1:30pm-3:00pm
