BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://signup.com/go/WiniixA"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Gain Speaking Confidence with Mare Island Toastmasters
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T203000
UID:260916_F-GQWKuFUmPTC2WFNQR9Q
DESCRIPTION:We meet in-person only on the 1st and 2nd Thursdays of the mon
 th. However\, you can catch us online every Thursday unless the meeting da
 te falls on a holiday.\n\nPlease register at https://signup.com/go/WiniixA
 \n\nWhat is Toastmasters About?\n\nUsually at our meetings\, we will have 
 a prepared speech\, and a speech evaluation. The Grammarian and Wizard of 
 Ah's will listen for turns of phrases and the use of filler words. We also
  practice impromptu speaking during the section of the meeting called Tabl
 e Topics. During Table Topics\, at a recent meeting\, we were asked what w
 e felt was the biggest communication problem or challenge. What would you 
 answer in a fast moment? Table topics will challenge you to think quickly 
 and give an answer without preparation.\n\nYou will also hear tips on publ
 ic speaking skills at our upcoming meeting. Whether you're a seasoned trav
 eler or just looking for some adventure from the comfort of your home\, th
 is event is perfect for you.\n\nToastmasters International is all about co
 mmunication excellence\, and for 100 years and counting\, Toastmasters hav
 e been expressing themselves better\, practicing\, and evaluating in a fun
  club environment\, shining all around the world.\n\nTo find out more--Msg
  us on our webpage \\(under Contact Us\\) button at\n\nhttps://mareisland.
 toastmastersclubs.org/\n\nIf you will join us in-person on the first or se
 cond Thursday of the month\, we meet this week at Kaiser Hospital Bldg. A.
  3rd floor meeting room. When you enter the hospital building\, go past th
 e piano to the elevator. Go to the 3rd floor. Exit left out of the elevato
 r and left at the hall. Go past the gym and take a left at the hall. Walk 
 down the long hall to the meeting room.
URL:https://signup.com/go/WiniixA
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group": "https://www.meetup.com/the-santa-rosa-spiritual-experiences-group/events/316474744/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_the_santa_rosa_spiritual_experiences_group
X-SOURCE:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group
UID:event_316474744@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045613Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T203000
SUMMARY:Listening to Your Inner Guidance—A Spiritual Chat for 18-40 yo
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Would you like t
 o make decisions that align with you spiritually?**\n**Are you looking to 
 strengthen your connection with your inner guidance?**\n**Do you want to l
 earn ways to listen inwardly?**\n\n“Listen to God’s Voice. Respond to 
 It spiritually and know that\, despite every appearance to the contrary\, 
 all is well and in its rightful place.”\n— Harold Klemp\, *ECK Wisdom 
 on Inner Guidance*\, p. 37\n\nYou’re warmly invited to this casual and u
 pbeat chat with other young spiritual seekers who want to learn more about
  the ways of the Divine. Come and share your stories or listen to others' 
 stories of how Spirit works uniquely with each of us.\n\n***Explore*** . .
  .\n\n* Ways to listen and increase your spiritual awareness\n* How to att
 une yourself to the guidance from Divine Spirit\n* Your true self as Soul\
 , a spark of God\, and your inherent divine intuition\n* Learn about a Spi
 ritual Exercise to deepen your understanding of the spiritual messages you
  receive.\n\nDrop in when it works for you and cameras are always optional
 .\nLooking forward to meeting you!\n\n**Welcome to Eckankar**\nThe teachin
 gs of ECKANKAR are based on God’s love and spiritual freedom for everyon
 e.\n\nThey offer you individual spiritual tools\, whatever your path or re
 ligion may be\, to bring you more understanding\, love\, and help in these
  challenging times.\n\nCome\, stay as long as you like\, and explore spiri
 tual resources that can help you\, at your own pace. Feel free to come and
  to go as you wish.\nThere is no pressure\, expectation\, judgment\, or un
 asked-for follow up.\n**We respect your divinity as a spiritual being.**\n
 \n**We honor your choices and your journey.**
