  also be posted on the forum. If you can lead one of the rides listed as "
 need a leader\," email ridedirector@srcc.com . NOTE: SIGN UPS ARE NOT REQU
 IRED FOR THIS RIDE - JUST ARRIVE AND RIDE! Level Leader Notes A Level Jac.
