DESCRIPTION:This event will take place at Kiwanis Park on Saturday\, Octob
 er 17\, from 8:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. Napa is excited to host its first-ever
  Chicago Big Softball Tournament\, featuring the iconic 16’’ softball 
 for an unforgettable summer showdown. Whether you’re swinging for the fe
 nces or just in it for the laughs\, this tournament is all about friendly 
 competition\, great food\, and even better company. There is no equipment 
 needed\, just rally 10–12 friends to form a team\, and get ready for a f
 ull day of softball\, camaraderie\, and summer vibes. For more event detai
