DESCRIPTION:Ready to take your stained glass skills to the next level? In 
 this class\, you'll expand your techniques by creating a beautiful stained
  glass photo booth frame that will hold a 2x6 photo and learn how to incor
 porate framing materials into your project.\n\nYou'll design your own uniq
 ue pattern by selecting from a variety of pre-cut glass squares\, copper f
 oil\, solder\, clean\, and finish your piece before attaching it to a fram
 e.\n\nThis class is ideal for students who have completed a beginner stain
 ed glass class or have basic experience with copper foil and soldering.\n\
 nAll materials and tools are provided. Glass colors and textures will vary
 \, making every frame a one-of-a-kind creation. \n\nImportant Health & Sa
 fety Information\n\nThis class involves the use of lead solder. Because t
 here is no known safe level of lead exposure during pregnancy\, this class
  is not recommended for anyone who is pregnant.\n\nIf you are pregnant an
 d interested in learning stained glass\, please contact us before register
 ing. In some cases\, a lead-free solder option may be available for privat
 e events for an additional materials fee.
