SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. Take 3 Jazz Trio
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T180000
UID:260915V21UdeNkBEe2ZNSQ_XLkIQ
DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come t
 ogether.\n\nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tast
 ing room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acros
 s the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll an
 d Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new soun
 ds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\nTake 3 Jazz Trio\n\nTake 3 Jazz 
 Trio is an all-women Bay Area ensemble performing tunes from the Great Ame
 rican Song Book. We play a mix of uplifting swing tunes\, smooth Latin tun
 es\, and soulful blues and ballads. Michele Korb is our vocalist/guitarist
 . Susanne DiVincenzo is on bass. Barb Raboy plays clarinet\, sax\, and flu
 te.\n\nDetails\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to
  fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and fa
 mily friendly!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/events/live-music-at-spicy-vines-13/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
