X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/dust-to-dust-artist-talk-and-presentation-with-kat?aff=cityspark"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Dust to Dust | Artist Talk and Presentation with Katie Murken
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T163000
UID:260924jKMEM6sm5kyjMQBHUt5Dyg
DESCRIPTION:Join Katie Murken as she discusses Steer Clear\, the pinnacle 
 work of her interdisciplinary series Dust to Dust. In this work\, she tran
 sforms discarded materials into a meditation on the environmental crisis a
 nd the silencing of women's voices. Murken will describe her overall proce
 ss of using found materials and documentary-style photography to weave her
  narratives into layered\, interdisciplinary works that defy categorizatio
 n. \n\n \n\n 
LOCATION:Petaluma Arts Center
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/dust-to-dust-artist-talk-a
 nd-presentation-with-kat?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://jarvisconservatory.ticketspice.com/mr-burton", "Press Democrat": "https://jarvisconservatory.ticketspice.com/mr-burton"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://jarvisconservatory.ticketspice.com/mr-burton"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:International Film:  MR. BURTON
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T180000
UID:260909n3a5TghUkEGhOOUVwj9zPA
DESCRIPTION:Mr. Burton tells the true story of the relationship between Po
 rt Talbot schoolmaster Philip Burton and a wild young schoolboy called Ric
 hard Jenkins\, the son of a wayward drunk. Richard dreamed of becoming an 
 actor\, but his ambitions were in danger of being derailed by a combinatio
 n of family trouble\, the pressure of war\, and his own lack of discipline
 . Mr. Burton recognized the raw talent in his pupil\, becoming his tutor\,
  strict taskmaster and eventually his adoptive father.
LOCATION:Jarvis Conservatory
URL:https://jarvisconservatory.ticketspice.com/mr-burton
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://eventvesta.com/events/160340/t/tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Haunted Wine Tour & Tasting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T173000
UID:260831kkRZbhh48U-rhG2M2vUrDw
DESCRIPTION:This fall\, Buena Vista Winery invites you to uncover the myst
 eries\, legends\, and ghostly encounters woven into more than 165 years of
  history. Led by Sonoma historian and actor George Webber\, this immersive
  90 minute experience journeys through the historic Press House and Champa
 gne Cellars\, revealing true tales of unexplained happenings reported by B
 uena Vista team members and visitors throughout the years.\n\nHear the sto
 ries of the Glowing Ghostly Shirt\, the Little Girl Who Says Hi\, the myst
 erious Ghost Party on the Second Floor\, the Old Man Who Walked Into a Sto
 ne Wall\, and other strange occurrences that continue to add to the legend
  of Buena Vista.\n\nAlong the way\, explore some of the winery’s most in
 triguing spaces\, including the Bubble Lounge\, Cave of Curiosities\, and 
 Wine Tool Museum\, while enjoying five Buena Vista wines tasted throughout
  the experience\, including a taste drawn directly from barrel.\n\nAnd\, a
 s with any journey through Buena Vista’s extraordinary past\, you never 
 quite know when the winery’s legendary founder\, Count Agoston Haraszthy
 \, may choose to make an appearance.\n\nHistory\, wine\, mystery\, and per
 haps a spirit or two await.
LOCATION:Buena Vista Historical Winery
URL:https://eventvesta.com/events/160340/t/tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
