UID:228a5c0b12622cf23696f0bbfe0a82f1@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:Long before plastic decorations and store-bought costumes\, Ha
 lloween celebrations were filled with handmade decorations\, paper crafts\
 , games\, and a little bit of mischief. Halloween parties were often intim
 ate gatherings filled with creative touches made by hand. Inspired by the 
 traditions of Jack and Charmian London’s era\, guests will spend the eve
 ning creating their own festive Halloween crafts using period-inspired des
 igns and materials. From spooky paper decorations to vintage-inspired keep
 s
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park\, 2400 London Ranch Road\, Glen E
 llen\, CA 95442
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/haunts-handiwork-a-halloween-cra
 ft-workshop/
X-SOURCE:Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
