URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/575/1792704600000
SUMMARY: Paint an Oil Portrait
DESCRIPTION:\nCLASS: OIL PAINTING FOR ALL LEVELS\n$380 includes all mater
 ials—paint\, mediums\, and oil-primed linen canvas\n\nThis is a five week
  course.\n\nRegister for class: https://www.parrcreate.com/page/711614 ht
 tps://www.parrcreate.com/page/711614\n\n https://www.parrcreate.com/page/
 711614\nOil painting doesn’t have to be intimidating! In just four weeks\
 , students will paint a portrait in the indirect style\, starting with a 
 grey value study\, building up with layers\, and finishing with powerful 
 details. The final result always surprises people: just by following basi
 c rules\, anyone can create a beautiful oil portrait that glows. Even abs
 tract painters can benefit from learning these techniques.\n\nKnowing how
  oil painting works gives us more confidence to develop our own authentic
  creative voice. As Maggie says\, “You gotta learn the rules to break the
  rules.”\n\nMaggie Parr started her career working as a show designer at 
 Walt Disney Imagineering\, where she designed theme park attractions arou
 nd the world. She also expanded into book illustration\, murals\, portrai
 ts\, comics\, and eventually\, writing books and scripts for television. 
 She also developed her own painting practice. To that end\, she studied w
 ith master teachers like Steve Huston\, Jeremy Lipking\, and Joseph Q. Da
 ily. She got an MFA and taught at the college level\, then developed her 
 own teaching methods for private and group study. Today\, Maggie maintain
 s a thriving business creating custom art and designs for corporations\, 
 individuals\, and non-profits.\n\nShe teaches other artists to utilize cl
 assical rendering techniques so they can confidently break the rules in t
 he service of their own work. And she coaches creatives in search of deep
 er authenticity\, healing\, and self-actualization.\n\n\nForms of contact
  below.\n\nhttp://www.maggieparr.com http://www.maggieparr.com\n\nPhone: 
 323.208.1226\n\nmailto:maggieparr@me.com mailto:maggieparr@me.com\n\n
CATEGORIES:San-Rafael,Oil-Paint,Portrait
