SUMMARY: Fresh Pressed Flower Card Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Jan Lochner\nDate: Saturday\, October 24th\nTime:
  2:00PM-5:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Location\nFee: $40.00\n\nThis is a h
 ands-on make and take class where you will make at least five items inclu
 ding a bookmark\, a greeting card\, a fridge magnet and an ornament. The 
 class will use two different techniques and Jan will explain how to press
  flowers and which flowers hold their color best. It is a creative experi
 ence!\n\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please contact Jan at: mailto:
 freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com mailt
 o:freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com\n\nCreating note cards from pressed f
 lowers has been Jan’s hobby for 25 years\, though she has no formal art t
 raining. She utilizes color\,\nshape and texture on fine quality paper\, 
 each card uniquely handmade. Jan’s home in Sebastopol is her studio: the 
 dining room table is her workshop\, the kitchen cupboards storing boxes a
 nd trays of flowers. She buys card stock by the thousand and picks blooms
  from her garden and other public places. Her family is used to me saying
 \, “could we stop for just a few minutes so I can gather some… ”\n\nIt is
  a wonderful way of life.\n\n*A note to all students: Please park on in t
 he East facing parking lot while attending classes. We greatly appreciate
  it. Thank you.
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa
