UID:b69a1620304e1e18154824e724aa6ddf@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:Los Colores de Otoño (The Colors of Autumn) is a community da
 y in Spanish for the whole family to enjoy nature\, art\, culture\, and th
 e season together. Come in costume and spend the day surrounded by papel p
 icado\, Mexican food\, art and crafts inspired by Halloween and Día de lo
 s Muertos\, and opportunities to get an up-close look at the region’s wi
 ldlife. There will be activities for kids and adults\, community organizat
 ions sharing resources\, and a collection of animal skulls and pelts to ex
 plore.
