X-SOURCE:Healdsburg Community Events
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate the 10th annual Día de Muertos celebra
 tion in Healdsburg\, honoring a decade of remembering loved ones through v
 ibrant traditions\, community\, art\, music\, and the enduring spirit of t
 his meaningful cultural celebration. There will be a community altar where
  all are invited to add a loved one’s picture\, as well as free kids act
