SUMMARY:In the Spotlight: Lawrence's George "Nash" Walker
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261027
DTSTAMP:20260811T154416Z
UID:20261026T070000Z-23088@calendar.santarosa.edu
