DESCRIPTION:Advanced Colored Pencil Workshop with Nina Antze (November 202
 6)\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          $45.00\n        \n      \n    
 \n  \n\nAdvanced Colored Pencil Workshop Tuesday\, November 10th\, 2026 10
 :00am-1:00pm $45.00These workshops are geared to the advanced\, ongoing st
 udents who want in-person instruction and feedback on their colored pencil
  projects. Please consult the instructor\, Nina\, for details before signi
 ng up\, by emailing antze@pcquilt.com. About the Teacher: Nina Antze is a 
 botanical artist\, quilt maker\, and teacher living in Sonoma County. She 
 has a degree in Fine Arts from San Francisco State University and has a Ce
 rtificate in Botanical Illustration from the New York Botanical Gardens. H
 er paintings are part of the Filoli Florilegium and Alcatraz Florilegium. 
 Please note\, this class will take place in the Painting/Drawing Room inst
 ead of the usual Dining Room. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
