  and academically.  Topics and activities may include:Sisterhood &amp\; co
 mmunity  Self-love and confidence  Academic &amp\; career success  Wellnes
 s and life skills  Leadership and personal growth  Cultural identity and s
 elf-discovery  For more information\, visit the Sawubona BLOC website. (ht
 tps://bloc.santarosa.edu/august-2026)  The Sawubona BLOC is located in Pio
 neer Hall\, Room 360 (next to the bookstore) on the Santa Rosa Campus.
