DESCRIPTION:Purchase tickets at <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http
 ://rfo.simpletix.com&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;ust=1757459083546
 861&amp\;usg=AOvVaw2vq81pY53HOoEIoPd2jiil" target="_blank">rfo.simpletix.c
 om</a>.<br>Presentations on astronomical topics are given in the classroom
  throughout the course of the evening. Starting at dusk\, the Observatory
 ’s three main telescopes are open for your viewing. Docents set up addit
 ional telescopes in front of the building. Friendly and knowledgeable doce
 nts are available to answer your questions. $15.00 per adult\; $10.00 for 
