 e and confidence  </li><li>Academic &amp\; career success  </li><li>Wellne
 ss and life skills  </li><li>Leadership and personal growth  </li><li>Cult
 ural identity and self-discovery  </li></ul><p><a href="https://bloc.santa
 rosa.edu/august-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information\
 , visit the Sawubona BLOC website.</a></p><p>  The Sawubona BLOC is locate
 d in Pioneer Hall\, Room 360 (next to the bookstore) on the Santa Rosa Cam
 pus.</p>
