DESCRIPTION:Dinner Show with JESSE DENATALE and BAND \nOne of Northern California‘s top singer/ songwriter gems!. Jesse DeNatale is a singer-songwriter from Northern California. He was born in San Francisco. He has released three critically acclaimed records: Shangri-La West (2000) Soul Parade (2006) and The Wilderness (2021). His latest release\, The Hands of Time\, is now  available on Blue Arrow Records.
